(14. By means of these seven considerations I can forecast victory or) Tj T*
(defeat.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(15. The general that hearkens to my counsel and acts upon it, will) Tj T*
(conquer:let such a one be retained in command! The general that) Tj T*
(hearkens not to my counsel nor acts upon it, will suffer defeat:let) Tj T*
(such a one be dismissed!) Tj T*
() Tj T*
